 The body of a CUSTOMISED automatic e-mail (Core\Mail\Template\
 EmailTemplateRenderer, ARCHITECTURE.md §8.7bis), dropped into the same
 frame every other e-mail uses.

 `body_html` is rich text an administrator wrote, already sanitised on
 the way in (Core\Security\HtmlSanitizer, SECURITY.md §7) and already
 variable-substituted as a plain string — it is never evaluated as Twig,
 which is the whole reason this template takes a finished string rather
 than rendering the stored content itself.

 The header, the footer and the unit's name come from base.html.twig and
 are not customisable: that is why `site_name` is never offered as an
 insertable variable.
#}
{% extends 'email/base.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}{{ body_html|raw }}{% endblock %}
